          "Hadith.1992 - It was narrated from Al-Ays bin Al-Qasim:\n\"I asked Abu Abdullah (as) about a woman who begins menstruating during Month of Ramadan before sunset.\nImam (as) said: 'She should break her fast as soon as she begins menstruating.'\""
